        <h3>Gearbox Design</h3>
        <p>Designed and analyzed a basic gear transmission system.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
        <h3>Heat Transfer Analysis</h3>
        <p>Studied heat conduction through a metal plate.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
        <h3>Lathe Operation Study</h3>
        <p>Calculated cutting speed and machining parameters.</p>
    </div>

</section>

<footer>

    <p>© 2026 Mechanical Engineering Portfolio</p>

</footer>

